Electric Heavy Trucks
Silent Power Athlete
 â†’  Powerful all-electric forklift combining high performance with zero emissions
 â†’ Heavy duty transport of loads up to 18000 kg with lift heights up to 9.5 m
 â†’ Excellent all-round visibility
 â†’ Choice of lead-acid or lithium-ion batteries for maximum flexibility
 â†’ Lead-acid batteries offer a highly cost-effective power solution
